                '\n'
                'Andrew R. Jassy. Mr. Jassy has served as President and Chief Executive Officer since July 2021, CEO '
                'Amazon Web Services from April 2016 until July 2021, and Senior Vice President, Amazon Web Services, '
                'from April 2006 until April 2016.\n'
                '\n'
                'Douglas J. Herrington. Mr. Herrington has served as CEO Worldwide Amazon Stores since July 2022, '
