    {   'source': 'NASDAQ_AMZN_2023.pdf (Page 75)',
        'text': 'Stock Repurchase Activity\n'
                '\n'
                'In March 2022, the Board of Directors authorized a program to repurchase up to $10.0 billion of our '
                'common stock, with no fixed expiration, which replaced the previous $5.0 billion stock repurchase '
                'authorization, approved by the Board of Directors in February 2016. We repurchased 46.2 million '
                'shares of our common stock for $6.0 billion in 2022 under these programs. There were no repurchases '
                'of common stock in 2021 or 2023. As of December 31, 2023, we have $6.1 billion remaining under the '
                'repurchase program.'},
