                'qualified property, primarily equipment. These enhanced deductions are scheduled to phase out '
                'annually from 2023 through 2026. Our federal tax provision included a partial accelerated '
                'depreciation deduction election for 2021, and a full election for 2022 and 2023. Effective January 1, '
