                '\n'
                'Overview\n'
                '\n'
                'Macroeconomic factors, including changes in inflation and interest rates, global economic and '
                'geopolitical developments, and the development and adoption of technologies and services, including '
                'artificial intelligence, have direct and indirect impacts on our results of operations that are '
