                '\n'
                '(1) For the year ended December 31, 2023 and 2024, this amount relates to equipment included in '
                '“Property and equipment acquired under finance leases, net of remeasurements and modifications” of '
                '$642 million and $854 million.\n'
                '\n'
                '(2) For the year ended December 31, 2023 and 2024, this amount relates to property included in '
                '“Principal repayments of finance leases” of $4,384 million and $2,043 million.\n'
                '\n'
                'All of these free cash flows measures have limitations as they omit certain components of the overall '
                'cash flow statement and do not represent the residual cash flow available for discretionary '
