                'center, office, and physical store facilities as well as server and networking equipment, aircraft, '
                'and vehicles. Gross assets acquired under finance leases, including those where title transfers at '
                'the end of the lease, are recorded in “Property and equipment, net” and were $62.5 billion and $56.5 '
                'billion as of December 31, 2023 and 2024. Accumulated amortization associated with finance leases was '
                '$44.7 billion and $41.8 billion as of December 31, 2023 and 2024.\n'
