    {   'source': 'NASDAQ_AMZN_2024.pdf (Page 73)',
        'text': 'Stock Repurchase Activity\n'
                '\n'
                'In March 2022, the Board of Directors authorized a program to repurchase up to $10.0 billion of our '
                'common stock, with no fixed expiration. We repurchased 46.2 million shares of our common stock for '
                '$6.0 billion in 2022. There were no repurchases of common stock in 2023 or 2024. As of December 31, '
                '2024, we have $6.1 billion remaining under the repurchase program.\n'
                '\n'
                'Stock Award Plans\n'
                '\n'
                'Employees vest in restricted stock unit awards over the corresponding service term, generally between '
                'two and five years. The majority of restricted stock unit awards are granted at the date of hire or '
                'in Q2 as part of the annual compensation review and primarily vest semi-annually in Q2 and Q4 of the '
                'relevant compensation year.'},
