                '2026 and may be extended for one additional period of 364 days subject to approval by the lenders. '
                'The interest rate applicable to outstanding balances under the Short-Term Credit Agreement is the '
                'Secured Overnight Financing Rate specified in the Short-Term Credit Agreement plus 0.45%, with a '
                'commitment fee of 0.03% on the undrawn portion. There were no borrowings outstanding under the '
