                'charges against us with the National Labor Relations Board (the “NLRB”), and they may do so in the '
                'future. In September 2019, an administrative law judge issued a recommended decision for Tesla on '
                'certain issues and against us on certain others. In March 2021, the NLRB adopted a portion of the '
