                'aggregate principal amount that will not result in (x) such Lender’s Credit Exposure exceeding such '
                'Lender’s Commitment or (y) the Total Credit Exposure exceeding the total Commitments. Within the '
                'foregoing limits and subject to the terms and conditions set forth herein, the Borrower may borrow, '
                'prepay and reborrow Loans. No portion of the Loan will be funded (initially or through participation, '
