                'Lenders. The Administrative Agent will make such Loans available to the Borrower by promptly '
                'crediting the amounts so received, in like funds, to an account of the Borrower maintained with the '
                'Administrative Agent in New York City or to such other account of the Borrower as may be agreed by '
