                'laws may harm us.\n'
                '\n'
                'Any failure by us or our vendors or other business partners to comply with our public privacy notice '
                'or with federal, state or international privacy, data protection or security laws or regulations '
                'relating to the processing, collection, use, retention, security and transfer of personally '
                'identifiable information could result in regulatory or litigation-related actions against us, legal '
                'liability, fines, damages, ongoing audit requirements and other significant costs. Substantial '
