                '\n'
                'Our financial instruments that are not re-measured at fair value include accounts receivable, '
                'financing receivables, other receivables, digital assets, accounts payable, accrued liabilities, '
                'customer deposits and debt. The carrying values of these financial instruments materially approximate '
                'their fair values, other than our 2.00% Convertible Senior Notes due in 2024 (“2024 Notes”) and '
                'digital assets.\n'
                '\n'
                'We estimate the fair value of the 2024 Notes using commonly accepted valuation methodologies and '
                'market-based risk measurements that are indirectly observable, such as credit risk (Level Il). In '
