                'are determined by us or a regulator to contain a safety defect or be noncompliant with applicable '
                'laws and regulations, such as U.S. Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standards, or provide certain '
                'functionalities. Such recalls or field actions, whether voluntary or involuntary or caused by systems '
